{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey through a labyrinth where music and minimalism collide. This game consists of numerous carefully designed levels that provide unique relaxation. Not only will you find your way out of the maze, but you will also enjoy the soothing music that fills the surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls are simple and intuitive, allowing you to concentrate fully on your journey of discovery. Escape the hustle and bustle of everyday life and treat yourself to some time out in peace and quiet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't worry, the enemies trying to silence you are not that scary. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916550/extras/86907a878cb36e5b03ec12596fc92c65.poster.avif?t=1759146696\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916550/extras/86907a878cb36e5b03ec12596fc92c65.webm?t=1759146696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916550/extras/86907a878cb36e5b03ec12596fc92c65.mp4?t=1759146696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fall for the illusion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916550/extras/e394b07a8fe322eb562706299b51f5e9.poster.avif?t=1759146696\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916550/extras/e394b07a8fe322eb562706299b51f5e9.webm?t=1759146696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916550/extras/e394b07a